sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as Platform Gateway<br/>(Envoy)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.3
    participant KRBAC as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>Sidecar<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant vLLM as vLLM API Server<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant Runner as HPUModelRunner<br/>Graph Compilation
    participant HPU as Gaudi HPU<br/>PCIe/Fabric

    Note over Client,HPU: Flow 1: Model Inference Request

    Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    Gateway->>KRBAC: Forward request<br/>HTTPS/8443, TLS<br/>SAR check
    KRBAC->>vLLM: Forward request<br/>HTTP/8000 (plaintext)<br/>localhost/pod network
    vLLM->>Runner: Dispatch inference<br/>Tokenize, bucket, schedule
    Runner->>HPU: Execute compiled graph<br/>HCCL / PCIe
    HPU-->>Runner: Tensor output
    Runner-->>vLLM: Generated tokens
    vLLM-->>KRBAC: JSON response
    KRBAC-->>Gateway: Response (TLS)
    Gateway-->>Client: JSON response<br/>(HTTPS)

    Note over Client,HPU: Flow 2: Multi-Device Tensor Parallel Inference

    participant W0 as HPUWorker<br/>Rank 0
    participant WN as HPUWorker<br/>Rank N
    participant HPU0 as HPU Device 0
    participant HPUN as HPU Device N

    W0->>WN: HCCL collective init<br/>Dynamic/TCP<br/>Fabric-level
    W0->>HPU0: Execute partial forward<br/>PCIe/Fabric
    WN->>HPUN: Execute partial forward<br/>PCIe/Fabric
    W0->>WN: All-reduce collective<br/>HCCL Dynamic/TCP
    WN-->>W0: Reduced tensors

    Note over Client,HPU: Flow 3: Disaggregated Prefill/Decode (NIXL, optional)

    participant Prefill as Prefill Instance<br/>vLLM + Gaudi
    participant Decode as Decode Instance<br/>vLLM + Gaudi

    Prefill->>Decode: KV cache transfer<br/>UCX (NIXL)<br/>Dynamic/TCP
    Note right of Decode: RDMA or TCP transport<br/>No encryption<br/>No auth
    Decode-->>Prefill: Transfer ACK
